    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i accidentally bumped my head pretty hard on the kitchen cabinet door just now. i have a small bump forming and a little bit of a headache, but nothing is bleeding and i dont feel dizzy or anything. i take eliquis for my afib though... should i just keep an eye on it at home for a bit or do i need to go to the er right away?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
