      "content": "Do not ignore your symptoms or make a home decision without consulting a doctor, as you are on **Eliquis (apixaban)**, a powerful blood thinner that significantly increases the risk of serious internal bleeding. You should **contact your healthcare provider immediately** or go to the emergency room today to have your head examined. Delaying care for head trauma on anticoagulant therapy can lead to severe complications that become much harder to treat the longer they go unchecked. Please prioritize professional medical assessment right now rather than waiting to see how you feel.",
